      {"author": "William Beebe", "work": "Half Mile Down", "quote": "From the surface skiff we observed a young **bonnethead** hunting crustacea along the muddy edges of the mangrove lagoon."},
      {"author": "Alexander Agassiz", "work": "Three Cruises of the United States Coast and Geodetic Survey Steamer Blake", "quote": "Trawling near the Florida keys brought up specimens of **bonnethead** sharks inhabiting shallow inshore banks."}
